Comments: [Evaluator: Christian Iliadis; Date: xx/xx/2023]
1.  Measured resonance strengths from Endt 1990, Iliadis et al. 1992, Iliadis et al. 1993. All values are normalized using the strength of the Er = 895 keV resonance.
    For the latter value we adopt wg = 0.258 +- 0.024 eV, which is identical to the result measured by Mohr et al. 1999. We do not use the weighted average listed
    in Mohr et al 1999, because it takes into account the strength measured by Goosman & Kavanagh 1967, which was derived using stopping powers from Whaling 1958.
2.  Direct capture S factor was estimated using the adjusted and averaged C2S values from Endt 1977.
3.  Low energy tail of Er = 315 keV has been estimated from C2S and the measured lifetime, but is unimportant compared to direct capture.
